17	/// The [FastAPI documentation] recommends the use of [`typing.Annotated`] for
18	/// defining route dependencies and parameters, rather than using `Depends`,
19	/// `Query` or similar as a default value for a parameter. Using this approach
20	/// everywhere helps ensure consistency and clarity in defining dependencies
21	/// and parameters.
